  "description": "Original abandoned mycelial signal-trade archipelago: three separated wet-lab-descended settlements over a dry buried maintenance network, with ceiling-rooted horn gardens and three dissimilar cargo stages. Alternating dense technical occupations and editable open sky rather than another central monolith, octagonal kiln, or continuous basin wall. Stage potential is concentrated around broken landing forks, the double-rise roof-horn choir, and excavated vaults.",
